{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212250","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212250","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1121225001:1":{"text":"하나, 둘, 셋... 여기 세 사람만 타시는 건가요? 저쪽의 마법사님은 안 가십니까?","source_cn":"一、二、三……只有这三位姑娘乘船吗？那边的魔法师，你上不上？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x23B4F35722882142","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"하나, 둘, 셋... 여기 세 사람만 타시는 건가요? 저쪽의 마법사님은 안 가십니까?","female":"하나, 둘, 셋... 여기 세 사람만 타시는 건가요? 저쪽의 마법사님은 안 가십니까?","variant_male_record_index":"118747","variant_female_record_index":"118748","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1121225001":{"text":"하나, 둘, 셋... 여기 세 사람만 타시는 건가요? 저쪽의 마법사님은 안 가십니까?","source_cn":"一、二、三……只有这三位姑娘乘船吗？那边的魔法师，你上不上？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x23B4F35722882142","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"하나, 둘, 셋... 여기 세 사람만 타시는 건가요? 저쪽의 마법사님은 안 가십니까?","female":"하나, 둘, 셋... 여기 세 사람만 타시는 건가요? 저쪽의 마법사님은 안 가십니까?","variant_male_record_index":"118747","variant_female_record_index":"118748","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121225002:1":{"text":"알겠습니다.","source_cn":"好嘞。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1BBB24524483EE5C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"알겠습니다.","female":"알겠습니다.","variant_male_record_index":"118749","variant_female_record_index":"118750","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121225004:0":{"text":"그럼 총 네 명이군요. 자리에 앉으세요, 바로 출발합니다.","source_cn":"那总共是四个人，坐好吧，我们马上出发。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4120BBE7AD26DDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121225005:0":{"text":"지금 가면 안 돼.","source_cn":"现在不能走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2E1C35CCC7ACB00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121225006:0":{"text":"네? 배를 안 타시겠다고요?","source_cn":"啊？你又不坐船了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4F4AFEB6DDE0E00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121225007:0":{"text":"큰비가 내릴 거야. 지금 출항하면 위험해.","source_cn":"要下大雨了。这时候出航，有危险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6C7393D22FDB3BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121225008:0":{"text":"무슨 소리십니까... 해가 이렇게나 쨍한데요.","source_cn":"胡说八道……这大晴天的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E15DD2FBE29397F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1121225009:0":{"text":"헛소리 아니야. 먹구름이 곧 몰려들 거라고.","source_cn":"我没有胡说，乌云很快就要来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42335B95DA0C2DDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1121225010:0":{"text":"예예예... 타든지 말든지, 안 타실 거면 어서 내리세요. 장사 방해하지 마시고.","source_cn":"行行行……你爱坐不坐，不坐就快下船，别耽误我挣钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F87590AE0F37764","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121225011:1":{"text":"잠깐... 정말 비가 와요.","source_cn":"等等……真的下雨了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24EA290F075A6683","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1121225012:0":{"text":"와! 엄청 짙은 먹구름인데.","source_cn":"啊哦！好厚的一坨乌云。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43FD5B19CDAF10B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1121225013:0":{"text":"일단은 비 피할 곳을 찾는 게 좋겠어. 내 털이 젖는 건 싫거든.","source_cn":"我们还是找个地方避避雨吧，我可不想弄湿自己的毛发。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8F12C7B187EF29D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:18:1121225014:1":{"text":"얼마 후... 비가 그쳤다","source_cn":"一段时间后……雨停了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x111E71102ED83E32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1121225015:0":{"text":"휴, 비가 정말 많이 오네요... 조금 전에 안 가길 잘했습니다.","source_cn":"呼，这雨真不小……幸好刚才没走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10E8F9C74F154ED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1121225016:0":{"text":"미안합니다, 아가씨... 내가 오해했네요.","source_cn":"对不起啊小姑娘……错怪你了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FB110C5C4719E75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1121225017:0":{"text":"다른 사람의 사과... 익숙하지 않아.","source_cn":"我不习惯听见道歉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FE261AABC6CEE24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1121225018:1":{"text":"특이한 아가씨군요...","source_cn":"奇怪的姑娘……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B99D36A31DF3082","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1121225019:0":{"text":"좋습니다... 다들 자리에 앉으세요. 이제 정말 출발합니다.","source_cn":"行吧……都坐稳咯，要出发了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3D4CCDEEA4B28FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1121225020:0":{"text":"여러분, 조심히 잘 다녀오세요.","source_cn":"各位，祝你们一路顺风。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3862A6D03B5C0EAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:29:1121225021:0":{"text":"작은 배를 타고 우리는 다시 익숙한 땅거미 숲으로 돌아왔다","source_cn":"坐上小船，